nodecode-good-student is a rewrite of harrylabsj's harrylabsj/hermes-plugin-good-student:

  https://github.com/harrylabsj/hermes-plugin-good-student
  commit 021375cf1cf0dad73d7a81b997f9a383be98c1ed
  MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Good-student contributors (LICENSE)

The plugin folder at that commit is a manifest, an MCP server entry and a
skill; the runtime it describes is the server in its own repository, fetched
at the pinned commit 2469cbb6f105b41a7a3ecc89b33df1f4543c06d9 of
https://github.com/harrylabsj/good-student, and the tool descriptions and the
analysis rules below were read there.

What was rewritten: the deterministic core, in Common Lisp, against the
Nodecode cell contract. Its fifteen MCP tools are twelve NLE:DEFINE-CELL
tools here, keeping the original's names, arguments and answers wherever
the answer is a fact (profiles, scores with their per-subject summary,
candidates, confirmations, weaknesses with status, risk, confidence and
evidence, the plan, the reassessment, the weekly brief, and a delete that
answers only the scope until the display name is given). The rules are the
original's: one error is suspected, a repeat across two sources raises the
risk, an error after a correction raises it further, and only a new variant
done with no hints moves a point -- a failed independent reassessment is
evidenced, a passing one improving, two in a row mastered, and a mastered
point whose review date has passed is due again; the pass line is 80% and
the review interval 14 days, both settings here. The study-action templates
are the original's reason -> action table, one per error reason, with its
duration, question count, reassessment day, acceptance line and what to do
when it does not pass. Its `/good-student` command and its guidance to the
model are a Nodecode slash command and manual topic.

What was left out, and why: the SQLite store (one JSON file in the folder
the section names, written atomically under the folder's lock, is enough for
one child's record and needs no dependency); the host-model recognition call
that turns images and PDFs into candidates (the model reading this page does
the recognizing, and hands the batch to good_student_ingest_candidates, so
no host bridge is needed); idempotency keys and the candidate expiry sweep
as a store job (candidates expire by their own timestamp when the waiting
area is read); the capabilities and doctor tools, which report on a host
this cell does not have; the error-code registry and the SQL-level export
of a whole profile (the records file is the export). The Chinese
authoritative skill and prompt files are folded into one English ground
rule: a candidate is not a fact until a parent confirms it.
